sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant Monitor
    participant Model
    participant Metrics
    participant Alerting

    Client->>API: POST /chat
    API->>Monitor: create request_id
    API->>Model: generate simulated response
    Model-->>API: answer + token usage
    API->>Metrics: record latency, tokens, cost, status
    API-->>Client: response + request_id
    Alerting->>Metrics: read snapshot
    Alerting-->>Alerting: evaluate thresholds
